        "whatsNew": "Standalone scanner: describe one object, identify it with Jev, confirm its box, then scan, review and export the observed 3D shape and measurements. Requires the paired Mac companion. Jev identification needs a configured TypeSafe/Jev API key; manual box selection is available without one. TestFlight uses public Apple processed depth plus the rear camera; the private sparse-sensor experiment is excluded. STEP is a faceted observed surface when supported; STL/PLY retain observed geometry. Live capture, dimensional accuracy and physical fit remain unverified.",
